# Actionable Defect Reports, Flakiness, Re-Test Protocol & CLI Gates

> Topic: Actionable defect reporting with unified `BLOCKER`/`MAJOR`/`MINOR` severities (`A10`), flakiness classification (`A14`), re-test protocol on the fixed revision (`A12`), and deterministic CLI `PASS`/`FAIL` execution gates for {{project_name}}.

